<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Project Status Report — Atlas CRM Migration — Aug 25–Sep 24, 2026</title>
<style>
/* ============================================================
   REPORT STYLE SYSTEM — single file · offline · no JS · system fonts
   Layers: 1 tokens · 2 base · 3 layout · 4 components · 5 utilities · 6 print
   ============================================================ */
:root {
  --paper:   #ffffff;
  --ink:     #1a2332;
  --muted:   #56677c;
  --line:    #d7dee8;
  --surface: #f4f6f9;
  --accent:  #1f4e79;
  --ok:      #2e7d32;
  --warn:    #9a5b00;
  --alert:   #b3261e;
  --draft:   #fff8d6;
  --text-2: 1.65rem; --text-1: 1.15rem; --text-0: 1rem;
  --text--1: .92rem; --text--2: .8rem;
  --s1: .25rem; --s2: .5rem; --s3: .75rem; --s4: 1rem;
  --s6: 1.5rem; --s8: 2rem; --s12: 3rem;
  --measure: 60rem; --leading: 1.5; --radius: .4rem;
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body {
  font-family: -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
  color: var(--ink); background: var(--paper);
  font-size: var(--text-0); line-height: var(--leading);
  margin: 0; padding: var(--s8) var(--s4);
}
h1, h2, h3 { line-height: 1.25; }
h1 { font-size: var(--text-2); color: var(--accent); margin: 0 0 var(--s2); }
h2 { font-size: var(--text-1); margin: var(--s8) 0 var(--s3);
     border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent); padding-bottom: var(--s1); }
h3 { font-size: var(--text-0); margin: var(--s4) 0 var(--s1); }
p, ul, ol, dl, table { margin: 0 0 var(--s3); }
a { color: var(--accent); }
a:hover { text-decoration-thickness: 2px; }
:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 2px; }
header, main, footer, nav { max-width: var(--measure); margin-inline: auto; }
header { border-bottom: 3px solid var(--accent); padding-bottom: var(--s4); }
footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); margin-top: var(--s12);
         padding-top: var(--s3); font-size: var(--text--2); color: var(--muted); }
nav ol { font-size: var(--text--1); columns: 2; gap: var(--s6);
         padding-left: var(--s4); margin-top: var(--s4); }
dl.meta { display: grid; grid-template-columns: max-content 1fr;
          gap: var(--s1) var(--s4); margin: var(--s4) 0 0; }
dl.meta dt { font-weight: 600; color: var(--muted); }
dl.meta dd { margin: 0; }
address { font-style: normal; }
.rag { display: inline-block; min-width: 5.5ch; text-align: center;
       font-weight: 600; font-size: var(--text--2); color: #fff;
       padding: var(--s1) var(--s2); border-radius: 1rem; }
.rag-green { background: var(--ok); }
.rag-amber { background: var(--warn); }
.rag-red   { background: var(--alert); }
.tiles { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(9rem, 1fr));
         gap: var(--s2); list-style: none; padding: 0; }
.tiles li { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius);
            background: var(--surface); padding: var(--s2) var(--s3); }
.tiles h3 { margin: 0; font-size: var(--text--2); text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: .04em; color: var(--muted); }
.tiles p { margin: var(--s1) 0 0; font-weight: 600; }
table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font-size: var(--text--1); }
caption { caption-side: top; text-align: left; font-style: italic;
          color: var(--muted); padding-bottom: var(--s1);
          font-size: var(--text--2); }
th, td { border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: var(--s2) var(--s2);
         text-align: left; vertical-align: top; }
thead th { background: var(--surface); }
tbody tr:nth-child(even) { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface) 55%, white); }
meter { width: 100%; height: .9rem; }
p strong { color: var(--accent); }
.lede { color: var(--muted); font-size: var(--text--1); margin: 0; }
@media print {
  body { padding: 0; font-size: 10.5pt; }
  nav { display: none; }
  section, table, .tiles li { break-inside: avoid; }
  h2 { break-after: avoid; }
  a { text-decoration: none; color: inherit; }
  tbody tr:nth-child(even) { background: var(--surface); }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <h1>Atlas CRM Migration — Status Report</h1>
  <p class="lede">Report #4 of 9 &middot; Period: <time datetime="2026-08-25">Aug 25, 2026</time> to <time datetime="2026-09-24">Sep 24, 2026</time></p>
  <dl class="meta">
    <dt>Issued</dt><dd><time datetime="2026-09-24">Sep 24, 2026</time></dd>
    <dt>Author</dt><dd>J. Okafor, Project Manager — <address style="display:inline">j.okafor@example.com</address></dd>
    <dt>Sponsor</dt><dd>M. Alvarez, VP Sales Operations</dd>
    <dt>Distribution</dt><dd>Sponsor, PMO, Delivery team, Vendor engagement lead</dd>
    <dt>Classification</dt><dd>Internal</dd>
  </dl>
</header>

<nav aria-label="Contents">
  <ol>
    <li><a href="#summary">Executive summary</a></li>
    <li><a href="#dashboard">Status dashboard</a></li>
    <li><a href="#milestones">Milestones &amp; timeline</a></li>
    <li><a href="#progress">Progress this period</a></li>
    <li><a href="#upcoming">Next period</a></li>
    <li><a href="#risks">Risks &amp; issues</a></li>
    <li><a href="#decisions">Decisions needed</a></li>
    <li><a href="#budget">Budget &amp; resources</a></li>
    <li><a href="#changes">Change log</a></li>
    <li><a href="#appendix">Appendix</a></li>
  </ol>
</nav>

<main>

  <section id="summary">
    <h2>1. Executive Summary</h2>
    <p>The project is <strong>amber</strong>: build progress is healthy and the cutover date holds, but data quality findings in the legacy Accounts domain now threaten the UAT start date. Budget is amber on contractor overrun, which we expect to partially recover in October. We need two decisions from the sponsor this period: the cutover freeze window and legacy archive retention.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="dashboard">
    <h2>2. Status Dashboard</h2>
    <ul class="tiles">
      <li><h3>Overall</h3><p><data class="rag rag-amber" value="amber">AMBER</data></p></li>
      <li><h3>Schedule</h3><p><data class="rag rag-green" value="green">GREEN</data></p></li>
      <li><h3>Scope</h3><p><data class="rag rag-green" value="green">GREEN</data></p></li>
      <li><h3>Budget</h3><p><data class="rag rag-amber" value="amber">AMBER</data></p></li>
      <li><h3>Risk</h3><p><data class="rag rag-amber" value="amber">AMBER</data></p></li>
      <li><h3>Quality</h3><p><data class="rag rag-green" value="green">GREEN</data></p></li>
    </ul>
    <p><strong>Budget:</strong> contractor integration work ran 8% over plan while waiting on vendor API credentials; recovery expected by mid-October. <strong>Risk:</strong> legacy Accounts data quality (R1) is the driver — see register. All other dimensions are trending as planned.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="milestones">
    <h2>3. Milestones &amp; Timeline</h2>
    <table>
      <caption>Milestone status vs. baseline plan</caption>
      <thead>
        <tr><th scope="col">Milestone</th><th scope="col">Baseline</th><th scope="col">Forecast/Actual</th><th scope="col">Status</th><th scope="col">Complete</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Discovery complete</td><td><time datetime="2026-09-05">Sep 5</time></td><td><time datetime="2026-09-04">Sep 4</time></td><td><data class="rag rag-green" value="green">DONE</data></td><td><meter min="0" max="100" value="100">100%</meter></td></tr>
        <tr><td>Data model freeze</td><td><time datetime="2026-09-20">Sep 20</time></td><td><time datetime="2026-09-19">Sep 19</time></td><td><data class="rag rag-green" value="green">DONE</data></td><td><meter min="0" max="100" value="100">100%</meter></td></tr>
        <tr><td>UAT start</td><td><time datetime="2026-10-05">Oct 5</time></td><td><time datetime="2026-10-09">Oct 9</time></td><td><data class="rag rag-amber" value="amber">AT RISK</data></td><td><meter min="0" max="100" value="70">70%</meter></td></tr>
        <tr><td>Cutover to production</td><td><time datetime="2026-11-14">Nov 14</time></td><td><time datetime="2026-11-14">Nov 14</time></td><td><data class="rag rag-green" value="green">ON TRACK</data></td><td><meter min="0" max="100" value="25">25%</meter></td></tr>
        <tr><td>Hypercare end</td><td><time datetime="2026-12-12">Dec 12</time></td><td><time datetime="2026-12-12">Dec 12</time></td><td><data class="rag rag-green" value="green">ON TRACK</data></td><td><meter min="0" max="100" value="0">0%</meter></td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </section>

  <section id="progress">
    <h2>4. Progress This Period</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Data model frozen after sign-off from sales ops and finance (Sep 19).</li>
      <li>Migration scripts completed for 3 of 4 domains — Contacts, Leads, Activities; Accounts blocked by R1.</li>
      <li>42 of 60 committed user stories done (70%); integration stubs for the 4 vendor APIs verified in the dev environment.</li>
      <li>Training material first draft delivered; pilot session scheduled with the field team for Oct 1.</li>
    </ul>
    <p><strong>Plan vs. actual:</strong> 8 of 9 planned items delivered. Accounts migration scripts slipped because profiling surfaced a 12% duplicate-record rate in the source system (see R1); remediation design is underway.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="upcoming">
    <h2>5. Next Period</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Accounts data cleansing sprint — dedupe rules applied, target &lt;2% duplicate rate (<time datetime="2026-10-02">Oct 2</time>).</li>
      <li>UAT environment build and smoke test (<time datetime="2026-10-06">Oct 6</time>).</li>
      <li>Security review with IT risk (<time datetime="2026-10-08">Oct 8</time>).</li>
      <li>Cutover dry run #1 in staging (<time datetime="2026-10-16">Oct 16</time>).</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section id="risks">
    <h2>6. Risks &amp; Issues</h2>
    <table>
      <caption>Top risks and issues (severity × likelihood; owner accountable for mitigation)</caption>
      <thead>
        <tr><th scope="col">ID</th><th scope="col">Description</th><th scope="col">Severity</th><th scope="col">Likelihood</th><th scope="col">Owner</th><th scope="col">Mitigation / next action</th><th scope="col">Review by</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>R1</td><td>Legacy Accounts data quality: 12% duplicate rate and 4% records with invalid owners would corrupt migrated pipelines and dashboards.</td><td><data class="rag rag-red" value="red">HIGH</data></td><td>Likely</td><td>P. Sharma (Data lead)</td><td>Cleansing sprint Oct; freeze new source edits during remediation.</td><td><time datetime="2026-10-02">Oct 2</time></td></tr>
        <tr><td>R2</td><td>Vendor API rate limits may extend full-load migration beyond the cutover window.</td><td><data class="rag rag-amber" value="amber">MED</data></td><td>Possible</td><td>D. Kim (Integration)</td><td>Batch-load throttling tested in dry run #1; vendor engaged on quota raise.</td><td><time datetime="2026-10-16">Oct 16</time></td></tr>
        <tr><td>R3</td><td>Single-person dependency on legacy CRM workflow logic (S. Nguyen).</td><td><data class="rag rag-amber" value="amber">MED</data></td><td>Possible</td><td>J. Okafor (PM)</td><td>Knowledge-transfer sessions booked; documentation of 10 critical workflows in progress.</td><td><time datetime="2026-10-23">Oct 23</time></td></tr>
        <tr><td>I1</td><td>UAT environment provisioning was blocked 3 days by a network policy change.</td><td><data class="rag rag-green" value="green">CLOSED</data></td><td>—</td><td>IT Operations</td><td>Resolved Sep 18; environment build now scheduled Oct 6.</td><td>—</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p><em>Changes since last report:</em> R1 raised (new), I1 closed, R2 severity raised from low after dry-run scheduling confirmed a single-load window.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="decisions">
    <h2>7. Decisions Needed</h2>
    <table>
      <caption>Asks of the sponsor — indecision past the required-by date has a cost</caption>
      <thead>
        <tr><th scope="col">Decision</th><th scope="col">Context / options</th><th scope="col">Impact of delay</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Approve production freeze window <time datetime="2026-11-13">Nov 13</time>–<time datetime="2026-11-17">Nov 17</time></td><td>Option A: full freeze (recommended, lowest cutover risk). Option B: read-only for sales, higher defect risk during reconciliation.</td><td>Cutover rehearsal planning stalls; field comms can't be scheduled.</td><td><time datetime="2026-10-09">Oct 9</time></td></tr>
        <tr><td>Legacy CRM archive retention period</td><td>Option A: 24 months (recommended by compliance). Option B: 12 months, cheaper storage, slower recall.</td><td>Archive vendor contract can't be countersigned; cutover checklist item stays open.</td><td><time datetime="2026-10-16">Oct 16</time></td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </section>

  <section id="budget">
    <h2>8. Budget &amp; Resources</h2>
    <table>
      <caption>Spend vs. plan (currency: USD thousands)</caption>
      <thead>
        <tr><th scope="col">Measure</th><th scope="col">Plan</th><th scope="col">Actual/Forecast</th><th scope="col">Variance</th><th scope="col">Note</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Spend to date</td><td>410</td><td>438</td><td>+28 (+6.8%)</td><td>Contractor overrun during vendor credential delay (I-series, closed).</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Forecast at completion</td><td>1,250</td><td>1,282</td><td>+32 (+2.6%)</td><td>Partial recovery from October demobilization of integration contractors.</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p><strong>Resources:</strong> data cleansing contractor (1 FTE) onboarding Oct 1 to support R1 remediation. No other staffing changes; no open hiring gaps.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="changes">
    <h2>9. Scope &amp; Change Log</h2>
    <table>
      <caption>Change requests this period</caption>
      <thead>
        <tr><th scope="col">CR ID</th><th scope="col">Summary</th><th scope="col">Status</th><th scope="col">Schedule impact</th><th scope="col">Cost impact</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>CR-7</td><td>Partner portal to receive migrated opportunity history</td><td>Submitted</td><td>TBC</td><td>TBC</td></tr>
        <tr><td>CR-6</td><td>Field-mapping additions for EMEA tax codes</td><td>Approved</td><td>None (absorbed)</td><td>+6</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </section>

  <section id="appendix">
    <h2>Appendix</h2>
    <h3>Glossary</h3>
    <dl>
      <dt>UAT</dt><dd>User Acceptance Testing — business users validate the system against real scenarios before cutover.</dd>
      <dt>Cutover</dt><dd>The controlled switch from the legacy CRM to the new platform.</dd>
      <dt>Hypercare</dt><dd>Elevated-support period immediately after go-live.</dd>
      <dt>CR</dt><dd>Change Request — a formally assessed change to agreed scope.</dd>
      <dt>RAG</dt><dd>Red/Amber/Green health rating convention.</dd>
    </dl>
    <h3>References</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="https://example.com/pmo/atlas-plan">Baseline project plan (PMO portal)</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://example.com/pmo/atlas-risklog">Full risk register</a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>

</main>

<footer>
  <p>Internal use only — do not distribute outside the distribution list &middot; Prepared by J. Okafor &middot; Questions: j.okafor@example.com</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
